Frequency once per round; 
Requirements The leviathan louse is using Cling to adhere to unworked stone; 
Effect The leviathan louse selects one square it occupies to drain of stony sustenance. It regains 15 Hit Points, gaining any excess HP as temporary Hit Points that last for 1 hour. The resulting rubble becomes difficult terrain. As part of their invasion of the Plane of Metal, denizens of the Plane of Earth attempted to weaponize leviathan lice to simply eat the enemy's fortifications. This didn't endear them to the inhabitants of the Plane of Metal. Removed from their normal environments and deliberately starved, the leviathan lice devastated both architecture and local populations with their insatiable appetite for iron. Farmers, miners, and jewelers see little practical distinction between leviathan lice and their waterwalking ore lice cousins, moving to eradicate any they see on sight
